## Evidence: `design_coherent`

- **Assumptions surfaced (PAEOS-6):** §6 — A1–A7, each with an explicit falsifier. A2 is
  flagged as the weakest and cheapest to check; A7 is flagged as the one that flips the
  verdict; A3 is disarmed by a published sensitivity interval.
- **Perspectives covered:** §7 — correctness, adversarial (CER-1 self-attack, three attacks
  answered including the conceded one), falsifiability, separation of powers (CER-5), scope
  discipline, downstream usability, anti-fabrication.
- **No orphan / no gap:** §8 — findings map 1:1 onto conditions; every condition lands on a
  real backlog node; every accept command, every §6.1b node type and every §4.2 envelope
  field is scored or excluded with a citation. The single non-closable gap (the
  `reviews/spikes/` path write) is a declared capability boundary, stated three times with
  its resolution command, not an unmet dependency.

Design is coherent and complete. The deliverable body is final; the only outstanding action
is a one-command promotion by a session holding `reviews/` write capability.
